    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Beast Skin Gu belongs to the skin Gu series, whose members are alike in build: like a bedbug, flat and wide, with a small head and an oval body. No color is recorded for Beast Skin Gu itself, though the same storage room shows Bronze Skin Gu yellow-orange with a faint bronze glow and Iron Skin Gu giving off a black iron glow.",
